🏋️ Gym Management System – Member Registration & Dashboard (Lightning Web Components)
📌 Salesforce Interview Readiness Bootcamp – Day 5

This project is part of my Salesforce Interview Readiness Bootcamp, where I developed a Gym Management System using Lightning Web Components (LWC).

The application demonstrates how Salesforce can be used to build modern, interactive user interfaces with reusable components. In this module, I created a Member Registration Form and an Interactive Gym Dashboard, providing the foundation for future CRM-based gym management.

Currently, the application works with static data. Future versions will integrate Salesforce Objects, Apex Controllers, and SOQL to manage live member records.

